          "line_end": 44,
          "line_start": 44,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "atrayee-dev/secure-ai-agent-boundary",
          "url": "https://github.com/Atrayee-dev/secure-ai-agent-boundary/blob/4c23100eddad59df384b6c0cf8d35bbbb7a6d52e/README.md#L44-L44"
        },
        {
          "commit": "4c23100eddad59df384b6c0cf8d35bbbb7a6d52e",
          "git_sha": "4a93cf7993237c445fd9ce88f79705250c72b42b",
          "line_end": 49,
          "line_start": 46,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "atrayee-dev/secure-ai-agent-boundary",
          "url": "https://github.com/Atrayee-dev/secure-ai-agent-boundary/blob/4c23100eddad59df384b6c0cf8d35bbbb7a6d52e/README.md#L46-L49"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d1c1da30ea1d58e23ad4477e24783009598340470864c7bcb04d529ba55ad38c",
        "slc_e6f3d0acad2082ca3fe9f7f740e81ecfbbbc195cbbc56f0326d2c7414bf73231"
      ],
      "text": "The core mechanism is a data-boundary contract: a YAML/JSON configuration stored with the source that defines scope, redaction rules, visibility level, and output filters for model sessions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9cd113858aebf4b2f6ac0392362c0c8383ae29dba1ad398344a60334768cacde",
