          "repository": "atrayee-dev/secure-ai-agent-boundary",
          "url": "https://github.com/Atrayee-dev/secure-ai-agent-boundary/blob/4c23100eddad59df384b6c0cf8d35bbbb7a6d52e/README.md#L55-L55"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_80b010e0833e849becb8d1ec9b6a6393c43de21d52ae3d347bcee4e964b8ecca"
      ],
      "text": "The boundary engine is language-aware, claiming syntax-tree understanding for 12+ languages including Python, TypeScript, Rust, Go, Java, C#, C++, Ruby, PHP, Swift, Kotlin, and Shell."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_cdf9165a326ce97d1c3437735199293e95d8b49efe3a9c77eaa75d1a79d9acd4",
