        "slc_ae06f28528e0e5d449ae94db4c6c1e2d6a82725a7652b920487d43158915b641"
      ],
      "text": "The README explicitly disclaims that the software is a security enhancement, not a guarantee: it cannot prevent all leakage such as side-channel attacks or undocumented model behaviors, and authors disclaim liability for data exfiltration."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_277a71ec135d91e705431fac4a18cd068217db1fd5990249f7852b76325ac122",
