        "slc_2c635d09f29c19843771f9abf4378999dc98c3e5f34c370dab507d5cb85e6c33"
      ],
      "text": "The framework is positioned as a decoupled configuration layer requiring no daemon, kernel patching, or heavyweight control plane, overlaying an existing Git workflow."
    },
